SUMMARY:PRX NA — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: PROSUS NV (PRX NA)\n\nDeal context:\nProsus N.V. (PRX NA)\, a Neth
 erlands-domiciled global consumer internet group rated Baa2/BBB (both Stab
 le)\, is launching a 144A/3(c)(7)/Reg S dual-tranche senior unsecured USD 
 benchmark offering comprising 7-year and 10-year tranches\, with investor 
 calls scheduled for Monday\, July 6\, 2026. The deal is coordinated by BNP
  PARIBAS\, BofA Securities\, and Goldman Sachs & Co LLC as Global Coordina
 tors and Active Bookrunners\, with BNP PARIBAS handling logistics. Concurr
 ently\, Prosus has announced tender offers on two existing notes — an any-
 and-all tender on its $614M 4.850% Jul-27 notes and a capped tender on its
  $1B 3.257% Jan-27 notes — indicating the new issuance is at least partial
 ly aimed at liability management and debt refinancing.
